				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Tough</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Stealth and Sleight of Hand</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Thieves' Tools</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Thieves' Tools, Dagger, Pouches (2), Traveler's Clothes, 10 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Raised in alleys, undercity tunnels, markets, or gangs, you learned to survive among people who had very little and trusted even less.</p>
		</description>
